<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>Disaster Relief Coordination</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/home.css"> <!-- new stylesheet -->
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>🌍 Disaster Relief Coordination App</h1>
    <p>Connecting people in need with volunteers and NGOs</p>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <form action="/add-request" method="get" style="display:inline;">
      <button type="submit">➕ Add Request</button>
    </form>
    <form action="/add-resource" method="get" style="display:inline;">
      <button type="submit">📦 Add Resource</button>
    </form>
    <form action="/dashboard" method="get" style="display:inline;">
      <button type="submit">📊 Dashboard</button>
    </form>
  </nav>

  <section class="about">
    <h2>About Us</h2>
    <p>
      This platform is designed to support communities during disasters.  
      Affected people can post requests for food, medicine, shelter, or rescue.  
      Volunteers and NGOs can offer resources, and the system intelligently matches needs with available help.  
      Our mission is to ensure faster response, better coordination, and maximum impact during emergencies.
    </p>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Disaster Relief Coordination | Built by Koushik PJ</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
